{"articleNo":"68843","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=68843&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"「금오문화상」현상공모","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.10.30","hit":"4129","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 20pt\">「금오문화상」현상공모</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&lt;금오공대신문&gt; 창간 32주년을 기념하고, 학우들의 문예활동의 장을 마련하여 건전한 대학문화를 창달하고자 우리대학 언론기관인 금오공과대학교 신문방송사 신문편집국에서 다음과 같이 ‘금오문화상’ 현상공모를 실시합니다. 창작이나 문학에 관심 있는 학우들의 많은 참여바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">모집부분</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">○ 시 : 3편 이상 (매수 제한 없음)</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">○ 수필 : 200자 원고지 15매 내외</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">○ 소설 : 200자 원고지 80매 내외</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">응모대상</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">본교 재학생 (대학원생 포함)</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">응모마감</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2012년 11월 2일(금) ★ 기간 연장 </span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">응모요령</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">○ 겉 봉투에 금오문화상 응모작품, 분야 표기</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">○ 응모작에 학과, 학번, 이름, 연락처 표기</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">○ 워드프로세서로 작성 후 출력물을 파일과 함께 제출</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">시상내역&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#bbbbbb\" height=\"25\" valign=\"center\" width=\"96\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">응모분야</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#bbbbbb\" height=\"25\" valign=\"center\" width=\"103\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">당선작</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid;